WEBVTT

NOTE
The Dollet SeeD Field Exam mission launch sequence.
Shows the approach from Balamb Garden to the Dollet coast.
Duration: approximately 1 minute 18 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Fade in. Galbadian jets fly in formation past a large full moon against a dark teal night sky.

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Balamb Garden floats through the night sky, its circular hull glowing teal from below.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
A SeeD transport seaplane lands on calm water near the Dollet coast under an orange sunset sky.

00:28.000 --> 00:38.000
Inside the transport, a soldier reviews a recon photograph showing Dollet's harbor and Communication Tower.

00:38.000 --> 00:48.000
The beach landing begins — SeeD soldiers charge down lowered ramps into fire and explosions.

00:48.000 --> 00:58.000
Aerial view looking straight down at SeeD landing craft racing across dark water.

00:58.000 --> 01:18.000
Two SeeD landing craft push through Dollet's stone harbor entrance under a red sunset sky.
